<SiteLayout title="MathLoop Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for MathLoop by Kroma Digital.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span><h1>MathLoop</h1><p>Privacy Policy for the MathLoop Android application.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose"><p><strong>Last updated: September 7, 2026</strong></p><h2>1. About this app</h2><p>MathLoop is an educational Android application for short daily mathematics practice. Kroma Digital maintains this privacy page as part of its unified app portfolio.</p><h2>2. Account registration</h2><p>MathLoop does not require users to create an account to use the app.</p><h2>3. Data collection</h2><p>The current Google Play Data safety declaration states that the app does not collect or share user data. Learning progress and app settings used by the app are intended to remain on the user's device unless a feature explicitly states otherwise.</p><h2>4. Purchases and platform services</h2><p>Where Google Play billing or other Google Play platform services are used, those services are operated by Google and are subject to Google's own privacy practices. Kroma Digital does not receive full payment-card details from Google Play.</p><h2>5. Children</h2><p>MathLoop is designed for learning use by children. The app should not request unnecessary personal information from children. Parents and guardians should review the app and applicable store information when appropriate.</p><h2>6. Changes</h2><p>This policy may be updated when MathLoop features, SDKs, advertising, analytics, storage, or data practices change.</p><h2>7. Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions can be sent through the Kroma Digital <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p></div></section>
</SiteLayout>